<title>SOUTH KOREA: SOCCER-RESULTS OF SOUTH KOREAN PRO-SOCCER GAMES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-RESULTS OF SOUTH KOREAN PRO-SOCCER GAMES.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of South Korean pro-soccer</p>
<p>games played on Sunday.</p>
<p> Puchon	3    Chonan	0   (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p> Pohang	3    Chonbuk     2   (halftime 0-0)</p>
<p>Standings after games played on Sunday (tabulate under -</p>
<p>won, drawn, lost, goals for, goals against, points):</p>
<p>			 W     D    L    G/F   G/A    P</p>
<p> Puchon		2     1    0     4     0     7</p>
<p> Chonan		2     0    1     9     9     6</p>
<p> Pohang		1     1    1     8     8     4</p>
<p> Ulsan		 1     0    1     6     6     3</p>
<p> Anyang		0     3    0     5     5     3</p>
<p> Suwon		 0     3    0     3     3     3</p>
<p> Pusan		 0     2    0     3     3     2</p>
<p> Chonnam	     0     2    1     4     5     2</p>
<p> Chonbuk	     0     0    2     2     5     0</p>
